{"id":"ccbc13-14:ccbc-14-26","answer":"LENGTH","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"请帮我简化一下纸笔谜题","html":"<p>下图给出了解答中所有星星的位置。\n<a data-asset-id=\"asset-4d5f17bc218a8ff78aa7200b\" href=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/1ff51d8eaef44c3b878a96ca7cfc2efa.webp\"><img data-asset-id=\"asset-4d5f17bc218a8ff78aa7200b\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/1ff51d8eaef44c3b878a96ca7cfc2efa.webp\"/></a></p>","text":"下图给出了解答中所有星星的位置。","assetIds":["asset-4d5f17bc218a8ff78aa7200b"]},{"number":2,"title":"请帮我简化一下【数据删除】","html":"<p>请提交 <code>HOWTO</code> 加上长度10的中间答案（即提交一个长度15的字符串），即可获得此资料的内容。</p>","text":"请提交\nHOWTO\n 加上长度10的中间答案（即提交一个长度15的字符串），即可获得此资料的内容。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"【数据删除】做完了，该如何提取？","html":"<p>和前一部分的提取一样，但只提取回路上的字母。</p>","text":"和前一部分的提取一样，但只提取回路上的字母。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"EVERYTWELFTHLETTERONPATH","messageHtml":"<p>这是本题的中间答案。</p>","messageText":"这是本题的中间答案。","extraHtml":"","extraText":"","assetIds":[]},{"answer":"USEONESTAR","messageHtml":"<p>这是本题的中间答案。</p>\n<p>如果在下一步纸笔谜题遇到困难，请购买标题为【数据删除】的资料以获取其简化版本。</p>","messageText":"这是本题的中间答案。 如果在下一步纸笔谜题遇到困难，请购买标题为【数据删除】的资料以获取其简化版本。","extraHtml":"","extraText":"","assetIds":[]},{"answer":"HOWTOUSEONESTAR","messageHtml":"<p>下图给出了解答中所有星星的位置。\n<a data-asset-id=\"asset-1a0e5ca5830677ba5e60a109\" href=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/17fc100700dc4489bf5cae38b4ee5ae4.webp\"><img data-asset-id=\"asset-1a0e5ca5830677ba5e60a109\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/17fc100700dc4489bf5cae38b4ee5ae4.webp\"/></a></p>","messageText":"下图给出了解答中所有星星的位置。","extraHtml":"","extraText":"","assetIds":["asset-1a0e5ca5830677ba5e60a109"]}],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>首先按规则解出纸笔谜题。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"星穹铁道二星\" data-asset-id=\"asset-c9820c1aa41b14acc42a4e34\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/bfe9545d5d1140848467886a65dce57d.webp\"/></p>\n<p>从上到下从左到右提取星星处的字母，得到 <code>EVERY TWELFTH LETTER ON PATH</code>。</p>\n<p>从蜥蜴处出发按路径走，每十二格提取一个字母，得到 <code>USE ONE STAR</code>。</p>\n<p>按照一星规则重新解出纸笔谜题。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"星穹铁道一星\" data-asset-id=\"asset-5059fb9f03c0cdb2a52a115f\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/2d16b59018904e30b4c3f5cb7fd18ffe.webp\"/></p>\n<p>从蜥蜴处出发按路径走，每十二格提取一个字母，得到 <code>ANS IS LENGTH</code>。</p>\n<p>答案即 <code>LENGTH</code>。</p>","text":"首先按规则解出纸笔谜题。\n\n从上到下从左到右提取星星处的字母，得到\nEVERY TWELFTH LETTER ON PATH\n。\n\n从蜥蜴处出发按路径走，每十二格提取一个字母，得到\nUSE ONE STAR\n。\n\n按照一星规则重新解出纸笔谜题。\n\n从蜥蜴处出发按路径走，每十二格提取一个字母，得到\nANS IS LENGTH\n。\n\n答案即\nLENGTH\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-5059fb9f03c0cdb2a52a115f","asset-c9820c1aa41b14acc42a4e34"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"desc":"长度","type":"problem","content-type":1},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-1a0e5ca5830677ba5e60a109","url":"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/17fc100700dc4489bf5cae38b4ee5ae4.webp","path":"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/17fc100700dc4489bf5cae38b4ee5ae4.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":8198,"sha256":"d2de1df1ad36382d3a61d3dee34be1f1cdcbff486f013dab9c6260e6a0e13246","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["additionalAnswer"]},{"id":"asset-4d5f17bc218a8ff78aa7200b","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/1ff51d8eaef44c3b878a96ca7cfc2efa.webp","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/1ff51d8eaef44c3b878a96ca7cfc2efa.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":10260,"sha256":"ff78a6597f6a79052bb9a99503e5e22a69a59e53292bec0533d925a5ff8f0446","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["hint:1"]},{"id":"asset-5059fb9f03c0cdb2a52a115f","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/2d16b59018904e30b4c3f5cb7fd18ffe.webp","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc13/images/CCBC-14/2d16b59018904e30b4c3f5cb7fd18ffe.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":9944,"sha256":"73a1